  "status": "published",
  "title": "Nutrition and mood",
  "summary": "Understanding the links between diet, the brain and emotional balance.",
  "sourceHash": "926e7e2e8723da956fd609c3571d12d13e4e64f79eb517472c4d240bfa77026f",
  "translation": {
    "from": "fr",
